<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney boosts PG&amp;E.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney boosts PG&amp;E.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney raised its rating on Pacific Gas and Electric Co to outperform from neutral, a source at the brokerage said.  </p>
<p>The office of analyst Bill Tilles confirmed the upgrade, but declined to provide further details immediately.</p>
<p>The stock was up 3/8 of a point to 23-1/8 in early trading Monday.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
